# 不放進映像：資料、AI 的 Token 與設定、相依套件、git、各種密鑰檔
data/
.aigile/
node_modules/
.git/
.wrangler/
*.db
*.db-*
.env
.env.*
.dev.vars
.cloudflare*.env
state.json
*.log
Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml
.dockerignore
# PLAT-460 測試、說明圖與開發工具不進映像（scripts 約 2.8 MB、docs 約 1.4 MB）；執行時要用的留下
.github/
scripts/*
!scripts/release-data.mjs
!scripts/script-hashes.mjs
!scripts/admin-rescue.js
!scripts/sqlite-to-pg.js
docs/*
!docs/ai-integration.md
!docs/api-reference.md
!docs/flows.md
!docs/releases-notes.json
